1
00:00:00,222 --> 00:00:03,862
(Howard:)...before my dad left
me and my mom...

2
00:00:03,859 --> 00:00:07,399
(Howard:)he used to... take me
to the comic book store.

3
00:00:08,463 --> 00:00:11,963
(Howard:)It was one of the few things
we did together.

4
00:00:11,967 --> 00:00:14,837
(Bernadette:)Oh. Howie, I had no idea.

5
00:00:14,837 --> 00:00:18,207
(Howard:)Well, I don't...
like to talk about it.

6
00:00:18,207 --> 00:00:20,977
(Bernadette:)Oh, baby.

7
00:00:20,976 --> 00:00:24,246
(Bernadette:)That story's made
up, isn't it?

8
00:00:25,614 --> 00:00:29,014
(Howard:)That's how much buying
a comic book store means to me.

9
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:34,820
(Sheldon:)I'd like your honest
opinion on something.

10
00:00:34,823 --> 00:00:36,023
(Penny:)Of course.

11
00:00:36,024 --> 00:00:37,554
(Sheldon:)Now, before I start,

12
00:00:37,559 --> 00:00:41,499
(Sheldon:)I need you to know that
I'm very excited about this,

13
00:00:41,496 --> 00:00:43,696
(Sheldon:)and anything you say

14
00:00:43,699 --> 00:00:45,769
(Sheldon:)that isn't
enthusiastically supportive

15
00:00:45,767 --> 00:00:49,267
(Sheldon:)will throw our entire
relationship into question.

16
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,240
(Leonard:)So...

17
00:00:53,242 --> 00:00:56,072
(Sheldon:)keep an open mind.

18
00:00:56,078 --> 00:00:59,078
(Amy:)I'm feeling a little backed
into a corner, Sheldon.

